Problem description:
Certify is exposing public key through jwks well-known endpoint [https://injicertify-farmer.dev-int-inji.mosip.net/.well-known/jwks.json|https://injicertify-farmer.dev-int-inji.mosip.net/.well-known/jwks.json]

Right now we are exposing following key types

# RSA
# EC K1
# EC R1

To fetch these keys, we are using KeyManager getAllCertificates.  After that we are using nimbus library to parse certificate and create JWK. Nimbus library is not supporting OKR/ED25519

Discussion and resolution:
[Ivanmeneges]: **Jira Assignee:** Piyush Shukla (no GitHub mapping found)

